# Architecture freeze

- Do not silently change approved architecture.
- Until DE 001 completes, `.ai/ARCHITECTURE.md` is `NOT YET DESIGNED`. Do not implement product backend, frontend, connectors, schemas, APIs, or orchestration.
- After architecture is accepted, cheaper implementation models consume it. Material deviations need an ADR and higher-tier review.
- Do not use Fable or Astra for routine implementation. Do not escalate merely because a task is long.
